{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/feec340aabd459d06231aab591c7c85e.poster.avif?t=1759331443\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/feec340aabd459d06231aab591c7c85e.webm?t=1759331443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/feec340aabd459d06231aab591c7c85e.mp4?t=1759331443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving on the streets is not easy. You have nothing: no home, no job, and no security. Fight to pay your debts and hold on to life in the ruthless streets of the city. Will you build an honorable life, or will you lose yourself along the way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/b47268d7bcb3cdf7411d037f065a089a.poster.avif?t=1759331443\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/b47268d7bcb3cdf7411d037f065a089a.webm?t=1759331443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/b47268d7bcb3cdf7411d037f065a089a.mp4?t=1759331443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd52 24 Hour Day Cycle &amp; A Large Map to Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This city reveals a new face every hour. Start working in the morning, find a safe spot at night.  <br>Manage your time well money is always needed to survive in this sprawling city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u267b\ufe0f Recycling System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash isn\u2019t just waste it\u2019s survival.  <br>Gather bottles, cans, scrap, and sell them at recycling centers to earn money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd32 Begging Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes asking for help is your only option. Approach people and ask for cash or food.  <br>Be warned not everyone here is kind. Some will ignore you, others may demand more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Theft System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seems unethical? Maybe. But the streets are ruthless.  <br>Be cunning and discreet a wallet or some food could keep you going another day.  <br>But if you're caught, the police won\u2019t show mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfc Pollution &amp; Cleanliness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street life gets you dirty. People judge by appearance.  <br>Staying clean improves social interactions. Public restrooms, fountains, and opportunities await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb0 Arcades &amp; Casino</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival isn\u2019t only physical it\u2019s mental too.  <br>Unwind in city arcades with mini games. Maybe fortune will favor you.  <br>Are you willing to take the risk?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845420?t=1759331443","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/dd6e28f4d3b55341d207cb6ad8d7e372452d8978/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759331443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/16f202b863706748dcdb0043cde4077a3f270c71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759331443","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/16f202b863706748dcdb0043cde4077a3f270c71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759331443","categories":[{"description":"S