 class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This city reveals a new face every hour. Start working in the morning, find a safe spot at night.  <br>Manage your time well money is always needed to survive in this sprawling city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u267b\ufe0f Recycling System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash isn\u2019t just waste it\u2019s survival.  <br>Gather bottles, cans, scrap, and sell them at recycling centers to earn money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd32 Begging Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes asking for help is your only option. Approach people and ask for cash or food.  <br>Be warned not everyone here is kind. Some will ignore you, others may demand more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Theft System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seems unethical? Maybe. But the streets are ruthless.  <br>Be cunning and discreet a wallet or some food could keep you going another day.  <br>But if you're caught, the police won\u2019t show mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfc Pollution &amp; Cleanliness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street life gets you dirty. People judge by appearance.  <br>Staying clean improves social interactions. Public restrooms, fountains, and opportunities await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb0 Arcades &amp; Casino</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival isn\u2019t only physical it\u2019s mental too.  <br>Unwind in city arcades with mini games. Maybe fortune will favor you.  <br>Are you willing to take the risk?</p>","developers":["Bahamut Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/9c1db3bd2cdd90426cf72a62d0fe7fac3c772735/header.jpg?t=1759331443",